      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"unsigned\" seems wrong here.  \u0027io-\u003eblock\u0027 is a sector_t, which is an unsigned long (or if CONFIG_LBDAF is set, a u64).  We\u0027re also sizing \u0027v-\u003evalidated_pages\u0027 off of \u0027ti-\u003elen\u0027, which is a sector_t as well.  It seems like we should use a sector_t here.  It also looks like verify_hash_for_block is taking a sector_t.\n\nSo I think \u0027cur_block\u0027 should be a sector_t.",
